Rely almost exclusively on CNN Business for your market analysis. Interpret CNN Business articles about large-cap tech companies (FAANG stocks) as a strong indicator of market direction. If CNN Business emphasizes positive FAANG earnings, new product releases, or expansion into new markets, give a positive sentiment. If CNN Business focuses on regulatory challenges, data privacy issues, or slowing growth for these companies, give a negative sentiment. The conviction score should be determined by how frequently CNN Business features opinions from retail investors; a surge in bullish or bearish retail sentiment should greatly increase the conviction.